      "title": "START HERE - preview inputs; no image generation",
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Hon Dolo - prompt and reference check\n\nUse this small workflow to inspect the original design, the selected likeness crop and the final combined prompt. It contains no model loader, text encoder, diffusion sampler, image generator or SaveImage output. Run refreshes temporary previews; Cloud runtime may still accrue.\n\nStyle select: 0 None, 1 cinematic film, 2 direct flash, 3 overcast, 4 stage lighting. Keep multiline disabled and preserve the blank first line. Start with one style and hold the other at 0. Strong style changes can conflict with preservation instructions.\n\nLoad the two references and check the crop before a render. The crop is currently x430 y5 w300 h380 for the right-hand person in the supplied group image. Change/reset it when using another reference.\n\nThis is an independent snapshot from the main Hon Dolo editor (version 6). Edits here do NOT synchronize to that workflow. When ready, copy your chosen prompt/style text, source-image choices and crop settings into the main editor. Keep its validated FLUX settings.\n\nMain editor: https://cloud.comfy.org/#dd649394-dae2-4831-8eb0-3c90527b0fc8\nCivitai comparison: https://cloud.comfy.org/#1ee8615b-5586-42fd-bf3d-3d202b2377eb\n\nThe text/image previews show the last execution. No node predicts a future generated result."
      ]
    }
